   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Hi,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">I am using datatables in a shiny app. <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">If I use the server side processing:</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">output$printrules </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">datatable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>rulesp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> options </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scrollX </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aLengthMenu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iDisplayLength </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>It&#39;s all ok, but when I try to do input$printrules_rows_all it just prints the current rows.<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">I&#39;ve read that rows_all isn&#39;t working on the server side processing. Then I switched to the client side processing:<br><p></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">output$printrules </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">datatable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> rulesp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> options </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scrollX </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aLengthMenu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iDisplayLength </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">(rulesp() is a reactive function that returns a dataframe)<br></p><p></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">And I am able to get the indexes of the rows. However the table is printed in a different way. The numbers become rounded and the table, somehow, gets messy. The 1.00000 become 1. And the spaces between columns become unformatted. This happens because the size of the columns vary. How to solve this? Is there a way to get the indexes in the server side processing? If not, how can I solve this strange behaviour?</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">P.S sometimes when I render a datatable, let&#39;s imagine that I put to show 10 entries, it will only show 5 and a bit unformatted. I need to change the page (NEXT) or so for the datatable to reajust. </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Thank&#39;s a lot<br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Server=TRUE</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-G-n_2SArytQ/VzyC51QQXgI/AAAAAAAAA3E/ro0YtAFKIsYTsDfCAWBzvI7H-k6_RJidwCLcB/s1600/server%253DTRUE.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-G-n_2SArytQ/VzyC51QQXgI/AAAAAAAAA3E/ro0YtAFKIsYTsDfCAWBzvI7H-k6_RJidwCLcB/s1600/server%25253DTRUE.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393454018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mM8DyRz79KhiWbvfcFzWR\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-G-n_2SArytQ/VzyC51QQXgI/AAAAAAAAA3E/ro0YtAFKIsYTsDfCAWBzvI7H-k6_RJidwCLcB/s320/server%253DTRUE.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Server =FALSE<br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7faoW8APm_8/VzyC2g1j-WI/AAAAAAAAA3A/pRJcLscXCR4QAoGIhcleL0amGHHlpoqUwCLcB/s1600/server%253DFALSE.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7faoW8APm_8/VzyC2g1j-WI/AAAAAAAAA3A/pRJcLscXCR4QAoGIhcleL0amGHHlpoqUwCLcB/s1600/server%25253DFALSE.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393454018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2I9L0f9XHxlyJbuXGmbqiL\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7faoW8APm_8/VzyC2g1j-WI/AAAAAAAAA3A/pRJcLscXCR4QAoGIhcleL0amGHHlpoqUwCLcB/s320/server%253DFALSE.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\"></a></p></div>"
